<mxCell id="c69" value="PUT replaces every editable field of the stored entity; fields absent from the request body are written as null/0, not preserved (the id is kept). DELETE removes the row but performs no cascade — interactions referencing the customer are not removed.&#10;Role enforcement happens in Spring Security before the controller runs: unauthenticated → 401, authenticated non-ADMIN → 403. A structurally invalid body → 400 with joined field errors (handler extends ResponseEntityExceptionHandler)." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica Neue;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1A1B1C;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
